---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Runestone Safari"
  description="Privacy Policy for Runestone Safari describing how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600">
          At Runestone Safari, we take your privacy seriously. This policy describes how we collect,
          use, and protect your personal information.
        </p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Account information (email, password) when you create an account</li>
            <li>Usage data to improve our services</li>
            <li>Location data when you use the map features</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2">
            <li>To provide and maintain our service</li>
            <li>To notify you about changes to our service</li>
            <li>To provide customer support</li>
            <li>To gather analysis or valuable information to improve our service</li>
            <li>To monitor the usage of our service</li>
            <li>To detect, prevent and address technical issues</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            Data Storage and Security
          </h2>
          <p>
            We use Supabase for secure data storage and authentication. Your data is protected using
            industry-standard security measures.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            Third-Party Services
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">We use the following third-party services:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Supabase for database and authentication</li>
            <li>Cloudflare for hosting and security</li>
            <li>OpenFreeMap for map tiles</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            Your Rights
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Access your personal data</li>
            <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
            <li>Object to processing of your data</li>
            <li>Request restriction of processing your data</li>
            <li>Request transfer of your data</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary mt-8 mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            Contact Us
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-2">
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <p>
            <a
              href="mailto:privacy.runestonesafari.1atjf@simplelogin.com"
              class="font-medium text-primary hover:text-primary-dark underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors"
            >
              privacy.runestonesafari.1atjf@simplelogin.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </section>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100">
          Last updated: January 5, 2026
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

